1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,003
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:05,739
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:05,739 --> 00:00:08,809
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:08,809 --> 00:00:13,614
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,614 --> 00:00:14,214
And so,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:15,549
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:15,549 --> 00:00:18,485
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,485 --> 00:00:20,954
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:58,525
That was fun!

10
00:01:00,193 --> 00:01:02,195
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:02,195 --> 00:01:04,865
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,865 --> 00:01:07,467
Today's breakfast is sweet potato congee

13
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,469
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,469 --> 00:01:12,406
there will be three sweet potato congee
stickers

15
00:01:12,406 --> 00:01:13,807
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:16,009
find where they are!

17
00:01:16,009 --> 00:01:18,345
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,151
Huh? What's happening here?

19
00:01:24,151 --> 00:01:26,887
Why has everyone gotten so round?

20
00:01:37,965 --> 00:01:39,366
Are you okay?

21
00:01:40,167 --> 00:01:42,169
Stay away from me!

22
00:01:42,169 --> 00:01:42,636
Huh?

23
00:01:52,446 --> 00:01:54,047
Is this a new kind of cold?

24
00:01:54,047 --> 00:01:57,250
Charge, charge, charge, charge, charge,
charge!

25
00:01:57,250 --> 00:01:57,851
Huh?

26
00:01:59,052 --> 00:01:59,586
Sorry, sorry!

27
00:01:59,586 --> 00:02:00,587
Are you okay?

28
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:02,656
Looks like you're fine. Bye-bye!

29
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:09,463
The young owner of the sweet potato congee
shop is back!

30
00:02:09,463 --> 00:02:11,598
Our illness

31
00:02:11,598 --> 00:02:13,333
can be cured!

32
00:02:13,333 --> 00:02:15,802
Huh? Your illness can be cured?

33
00:02:15,802 --> 00:02:18,338
Just chase after him and you'll see

34
00:02:19,539 --> 00:02:21,942
Charge, charge, charge, charge, charge,
charge!

35
00:02:21,942 --> 00:02:25,012
Grandma, I've brought back
super-nutritious sweet potatoes!

36
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,015
Great!

37
00:02:30,083 --> 00:02:31,351
Quickly, go make...

38
00:02:31,351 --> 00:02:34,755
I'm going to cook super-nutritious sweet
potato congee right now

39
00:03:01,248 --> 00:03:02,983
Grandma, it's ready!

40
00:03:10,857 --> 00:03:11,992
Grandma, what did you say?

41
00:03:11,992 --> 00:03:12,793
Doesn't it taste good?

42
00:03:12,793 --> 00:03:13,460
Grandma? Grandma?

43
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:15,395
Quick, take out the spoon!

44
00:03:17,064 --> 00:03:18,532
You scalded Grandma!

45
00:03:24,938 --> 00:03:26,339
Grandma, please try some

46
00:03:45,892 --> 00:03:48,628
Beelu, thank you

47
00:03:48,628 --> 00:03:50,297
The super-nutritious sweet potatoes from
Super-Nutrition Farm

48
00:03:50,297 --> 00:03:53,166
made into super-nutritious sweet potato
congee

49
00:03:53,166 --> 00:03:56,036
really can cure Ball Disease

50
00:03:56,036 --> 00:03:57,370
Ball Disease?

51
00:03:58,638 --> 00:04:01,441
It's a new contagious disease

52
00:04:03,577 --> 00:04:06,580
Everyone who catches it turns round like a
ball

53
00:04:08,381 --> 00:04:11,585
A-Bao, take the super-nutritious sweet
potato congee

54
00:04:11,585 --> 00:04:13,653
and give it to the sick people

55
00:04:13,653 --> 00:04:15,589
No problem. I'll go right now

56
00:04:21,595 --> 00:04:24,531
There are so many sick people now

57
00:04:24,531 --> 00:04:25,732
and this pot is so small

58
00:04:25,732 --> 00:04:27,801
There's nowhere near enough for everyone

59
00:04:28,802 --> 00:04:32,539
I didn't expect Ball Disease to spread so
quickly

60
00:04:34,674 --> 00:04:36,343
A-Bao, calm down

61
00:04:39,746 --> 00:04:43,150
Let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout and
think of a solution

62
00:04:45,619 --> 00:04:49,089
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

63
00:04:49,089 --> 00:04:50,891
Clap! Clap!

64
00:04:50,891 --> 00:04:52,826
Jump up!

65
00:04:52,826 --> 00:04:56,429
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

66
00:04:56,429 --> 00:04:58,632
Clap! Clap!

67
00:04:58,632 --> 00:05:01,434
Bi Ru Akokay

68
00:05:02,702 --> 00:05:07,574
Charge, charge, charge, charge, charge,
charge!

69
00:05:07,574 --> 00:05:08,975
A-Bao, wait for me!

70
00:05:11,044 --> 00:05:13,313
We have to get to Super-Nutrition Farm
quickly

71
00:05:13,313 --> 00:05:15,382
and get more super-nutritious sweet
potatoes

72
00:05:15,382 --> 00:05:16,449
I know

73
00:05:16,449 --> 00:05:18,451
I've thought of a way

74
00:05:24,124 --> 00:05:25,325
That's strange

75
00:05:25,725 --> 00:05:27,194
How did this happen?

76
00:05:27,794 --> 00:05:30,864
Grandpa, I need more super-nutritious
sweet potatoes

77
00:05:30,864 --> 00:05:34,000
Huh? Didn't you just come by?

78
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,403
There are more sick people now

79
00:05:36,403 --> 00:05:38,271
Oh, all right

80
00:05:38,271 --> 00:05:41,074
But I need your help

81
00:05:41,074 --> 00:05:42,742
For some reason,

82
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,149
I can't dig up my sweet potatoes

83
00:05:49,149 --> 00:05:50,817
I can't pull them out either

84
00:05:51,551 --> 00:05:52,953
We'll help you!

85
00:05:54,087 --> 00:06:00,961
One, two, HEAVE!

86
00:06:06,099 --> 00:06:08,902
Why are these sweet potatoes so hard to
pull out?

87
00:06:08,902 --> 00:06:09,703
Keep going!

88
00:06:09,703 --> 00:06:12,038
You can do it!

89
00:06:12,038 --> 00:06:14,174
One, two, HEAVE!

90
00:06:24,718 --> 00:06:27,120
Ah! Why am I getting round?

91
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,988
Grandpa!

92
00:06:31,258 --> 00:06:32,726
The virus has spread here too

93
00:06:32,726 --> 00:06:34,995
What should we do? What should we do?

94
00:06:34,995 --> 00:06:36,997
A-Bao, calm down

95
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,134
At a time like this,

96
00:06:41,134 --> 00:06:44,004
everyone should do the Breakfast Brain
Workout together

97
00:06:44,004 --> 00:06:46,139
and think of a good idea

98
00:07:03,290 --> 00:07:05,025
It's Brain Workout Time!

99
00:07:05,025 --> 00:07:08,695
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

100
00:07:08,695 --> 00:07:10,563
Clap! Clap!

101
00:07:10,563 --> 00:07:10,830
Jump up!

102
00:07:10,964 --> 00:07:12,432
Jump up!

103
00:07:12,432 --> 00:07:16,236
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

104
00:07:16,236 --> 00:07:17,771
Clap! Clap!

105
00:07:17,837 --> 00:07:19,773
Jump up!

106
00:07:19,773 --> 00:07:23,443
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

107
00:07:23,443 --> 00:07:25,645
Clap! Clap!

108
00:07:25,645 --> 00:07:27,781
Bi Ru Akokay

109
00:07:30,383 --> 00:07:31,251
A-Bao!

110
00:07:31,251 --> 00:07:33,253
I've got a good idea

111
00:07:36,056 --> 00:07:37,924
A-Bao, I'm counting on you

112
00:07:37,924 --> 00:07:39,125
No problem!

113
00:07:39,125 --> 00:07:43,997
Charge, charge, charge, charge, charge,
charge!

114
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:48,134
A-Bao, how did you get back so quickly?

115
00:07:48,134 --> 00:07:49,202
Grandma, I'm heading out now

116
00:07:49,202 --> 00:07:50,470
I'll explain later

117
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:56,276
All right, now we just have to wait for
A-Bao to return

118
00:07:56,276 --> 00:07:57,477
Here he comes! Here he comes!

119
00:07:59,412 --> 00:08:00,814
Everyone, eat up!

120
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:10,623
Beelu, now!

121
00:08:10,623 --> 00:08:11,958
Pull hard!

122
00:08:22,168 --> 00:08:25,105
Wow, that's a huge sweet potato!

123
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,908
Come on, don't push!

124
00:08:28,908 --> 00:08:30,777
There's plenty of sweet potato congee

125
00:08:30,777 --> 00:08:32,912
There's enough for everyone!

126
00:08:46,926 --> 00:08:48,395
Great!

127
00:08:48,395 --> 00:08:50,997
My stomach feels so bloated

128
00:08:50,997 --> 00:08:52,999
I feel so uncomfortable

129
00:08:52,999 --> 00:08:54,934
Beelu, are you sick too?

130
00:08:56,002 --> 00:08:57,404
No

131
00:08:57,404 --> 00:09:00,874
Your sweet potato congee is just so
delicious

132
00:09:00,874 --> 00:09:03,343
I accidentally ate too much

133
00:09:03,343 --> 00:09:04,677
Oh, I see

134
00:09:08,548 --> 00:09:10,483
That was fun!

135
00:09:21,428 --> 00:09:23,096
Let's find breakfast!

136
00:09:23,096 --> 00:09:24,964
Here are the answers!

137
00:09:24,964 --> 00:09:27,434
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

138
00:09:31,638 --> 00:09:32,839
Did you find them?

139
00:09:36,042 --> 00:09:38,378
Yeah, I knew it!

140
00:09:40,113 --> 00:09:42,715
How do you make delicious sweet potato
congee?

141
00:09:42,715 --> 00:09:46,119
First, wash the sweet potatoes

142
00:09:46,119 --> 00:09:47,120
Peel them

143
00:09:50,323 --> 00:09:51,658
Cut them into small pieces

144
00:09:52,659 --> 00:09:54,594
Next, wash the rice

145
00:09:54,594 --> 00:09:56,663
Put the rice, sweet potatoes, and water

146
00:09:56,663 --> 00:09:58,598
into a pot and cook

147
00:10:01,468 --> 00:10:02,869
Remember to stir while it cooks

148
00:10:02,869 --> 00:10:04,604
or the bottom of the pot will burn

149
00:10:07,273 --> 00:10:08,074
Finally,

150
00:10:08,074 --> 00:10:09,342
wait until the sweet potatoes are cooked
through

151
00:10:09,342 --> 00:10:11,077
and the rice has broken down into a
porridge

152
00:10:12,812 --> 00:10:15,548
And a delicious pot of sweet potato congee
is ready!

153
00:10:16,282 --> 00:10:19,219
Wow, it looks delicious!

154
00:10:23,623 --> 00:10:26,092
Sweet potatoes are really delicious!

155
00:10:30,296 --> 00:10:32,699
Grandma, why do sweet potatoes make you
fart?

156
00:10:33,166 --> 00:10:35,168
Oh, that's because...

157
00:10:35,168 --> 00:10:38,438
Sweet potatoes are rich in fiber

158
00:10:38,438 --> 00:10:41,040
Oh, fiber?

159
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,709
What does it do?

160
00:10:44,777 --> 00:10:49,115
After we eat sweet potatoes,

161
00:10:49,115 --> 00:10:50,650
the fiber in them

162
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:53,786
reacts with the bacteria in our intestines

163
00:10:53,786 --> 00:10:55,522
and produces gas

164
00:10:56,789 --> 00:10:59,726
It also helps the intestines move more
quickly

165
00:11:00,994 --> 00:11:03,530
As the intestines move,

166
00:11:03,530 --> 00:11:05,932
the gas is pushed out of the body

167
00:11:05,932 --> 00:11:07,934
That's what a fart is!

168
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:13,006
Oh, I see!

169
00:11:15,008 --> 00:11:16,276
Healthy intestinal movement

170
00:11:16,276 --> 00:11:18,411
also helps us have bowel movements

171
00:11:19,078 --> 00:11:21,214
It carries waste from inside the body

172
00:11:21,214 --> 00:11:24,551
out along with our poop

173
00:11:24,551 --> 00:11:27,153
and keeps our bodies healthy

174
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:30,290
I didn't know sweet potatoes were so
powerful!

175
00:11:30,290 --> 00:11:32,425
Then I'll eat some more

176
00:11:34,027 --> 00:11:36,696
There are lots of other nutritious foods
too

177
00:11:36,696 --> 00:11:39,165
We should eat a balanced variety of them

178
00:11:39,165 --> 00:11:42,168
It's not good to eat only one kind of food

179
00:11:43,036 --> 00:11:44,504
You're right
